            "action_name": {
              "value": "Brutal Blow"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The spinesnapper makes a claw or weapon Strike. If it hits, in addition to dealing damage, the creature must attempt a DC 22 Fortitude saving throw, with the following effects.\n\nCritical Success: The creature is unaffected and the spinesnapper is flat-footed until the start of its next turn.\nSuccess: The creature is unaffected.\nFailure: The creature is pushed 10 feet.\nCritical Failure: The target is pushed 10 feet and knocked prone."
            },
